# This repo's own handoff is a local development artifact, not a deliverable.
# It is deliberately untracked: if it shipped, cloning this repo would inject the
# maintainer's build notes into the cloner's session via the SessionStart hook.
# A handoff belongs to the project it documents and travels no further.
# Use skills/session-handoff/reference/example.md as the public worked example.
SESSION_HANDOFF.md
